-- and the direction that does not exist: a weaker warrant cannot produce a stronger one. Where there is
-- no in-house standard for a compound, the Level 1 warrant is uninhabited, and no quantity of library
-- matching constructs an inhabitant of it — which is why 10% to 20% of features in an untargeted
-- experiment reach Level 1 or Level 2 at all and the rest stay anonymous, and why on average 1.8% of
-- spectra are annotated against the 60 million molecules of PubChem and the 220,000 reference spectra
-- covering about 20,000 of them.
no-upgrade : (Unit → Empty) → Empty
no-upgrade f = f unit
